e-thread-first design | Parallel by construction, correct on one worker (inline mode) | architecture-governance None\nL26 Monolithic subsystems | Contracts + focused experts | engine-architect None\nL27 ECS for everything (new dogma) | Per-domain ADR with workload evidence | architecture-governance None\nL28 Global renderer sync & CPU/GPU flushes | Render-graph-derived barriers; external work imported with queue transfers | render-graph-scheduling None\nL29 Runtime shader/PSO compilation on first use | PSO coverage from play traces, precompiled/pipeline libraries, async creation with fallbacks | shader-system None\nL30 Frame-coupled variable-timestep simulation | Fixed/declared step with interpolation per C-FRAME | frame-orchestration ['variable[- ]timestep|render frame delta']\nL31 Hard-reference transitive load graphs | Soft references, dependency-aware loading with budgets | resource-streaming-architect None\nL32 Process-global current world | World handles; multiple isolated worlds | entity-object-model None\nL33 Per-connection property polling replication | Push/dirty tracking, serialize once, O(changes) | replication None\nL34 Global shared RNG used from parallel tasks | Counter-based / per-stream RNG for parallel determinism | math-simd-numerics None\nL35 Stringly-typed or polling UI binding | Change-notified view models with resolved bindings | ui-architect None\nL36 Per-body sync callbacks & mid-step world mutation | Active-set/change-set output, batched queries, deferred commands | physics-architect None\nL37 Modal, blocking editor operations | Asynchronous, cancellable editor jobs with progress | editor-architect None\nL38 Snapshot-based undo | Serializable, diff-based commands | editor-architect ['snapshot-based undo']\nL39 Monolithic binary scene/asset files | One-file-per-object layout with semantic merge | world-data-model ['monolithic binary']\nL40 Editor-only data fields in runtime types | Editor/runtime data separation | editor-architect None\nL41 